    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/e0b2b6bceb9fc11fcdb70ee0a79313af.poster.avif?t=1748373968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/e0b2b6bceb9fc11fcdb70ee0a79313af.webm?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/e0b2b6bceb9fc11fcdb70ee0a79313af.mp4?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as Dahlia and Axo, helping each other, navigating this epic adventure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dahlia awakens from an eternal sleep with no memories. The kingdom lies in ruin, overrun by the Crystal Plague. Joined by Axo, her flying axolotl companion, they must explore the ancient world of the Amary, battle corrupted creatures, and outsmart deadly traps.<br><br>Uncover Dahlia's true identity and unravel the mystery behind the kingdom's fall, only then could its destiny be rewritten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a vast, beautiful world and solve the mysteries of four different races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> a formidable collection of foes and bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> for every challenge with powerful new skills and abilities for Dahlia and Axo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/126022a935acb780da0deac42ca118bd.poster.avif?t=1748373968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/126022a935acb780da0deac42ca118bd.webm?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/126022a935acb780da0deac42ca118bd.mp4?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/f6326c337a4768eecd5f02b272fd43d2.avif?t=1748373968\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the mysterious world of the Amary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dahlia gets free thanks to an unlikely ally and realizes is surrounded by enemies left and right. She stumbles upon a wrecked ship, where a surprise symbiosis bond is formed with between Dahlia and Axo. So now together they will unlock the secrets of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They explore a world of four distinguished races. All of their lands decayed because of the Crystal Plague outbreak. Now all citizens roam the realms as mindless zombies, only to attack Dahlia and Axo at first sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are both triggering the enemies, but what is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/2dfa70a7c2c4a4da6572613f16873196.poster.avif?t=1748373968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/2dfa70a7c2c4a4da6572613f16873196.webm?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/2dfa70a7c2c4a4da6572613f16873196.mp4?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/4774b022bcfc03b3ed8baad335bbb121.avif?t=1748373968\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight through distinguished foes and bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new area you\u2019ll encounter unique and strange creatures, most of whom want to devour you. Combat is strategic, requiring Dahlia and Axo to study enemy patterns and use their skills with precision and timing. With variety of over 100 enemies, from swift hunters to towering behemoths, combat stays engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/35d9cd775ef8065d859be70b6149d43a.poster.avif?t=1748373968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/35d9cd775ef8065d859be70b6149d43a.webm?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/35d9cd775ef8065d859be70b6149d43a.mp4?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/c688669b34fc15320c0819b9a58f1f9e.avif?t=1748373968\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Dahlia and Axo's abilities and skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When exploring the world, Dahlia and Axo, will encounter a variety of runes and skills to gather, craft, unlock and\u00a0fight to gain. These will help them enhance their fighting style and fine tune different playstyle to use during their adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/58df44b9ba5ac876cdb83ebb72467ee3.poster.avif?t=1748373968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/58df44b9ba5ac876cdb83ebb72467ee3.webm?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/58df44b9ba5ac876cdb83ebb72467ee3.mp4?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on our discord channel to become a part of the community that helps create the best possible version of the game. Together we can build a great metroidvania with tons of more biomes, enemies, NPCs, expanded narrative, levels,  bosses, runes, skills, and much more.<br><br>Play the demo and give us your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/56faa0cbb48112801fa17d7854d2914d.poster.avif?t=1748373968\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/56faa0cbb48112801fa17d7854d2914d.webm?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/56faa0cbb48112801fa17d7854d2914d.mp4?t=1748373968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Follow us for more news, here on the Steam announcements.</p>",
