    "short_description": "Step into an epic 2D hand-drawn Metroidvania, where mystery, danger, and beauty intertwine. Dahlia emerges with no memories and a kingdom in ruins. Joined by a flying companion, Axo, they must battle corrupted creatures and unravel the secrets of the Crystal Plague.",
